#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Fundamentals of quantum algorithms, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para obtener tu insignia de Fundamentos de algoritmos cuánticos, realiza el "
"examen en IBM&reg; Training. Este examen está diseñado para ser realizado "
"después de trabajar con las lecciones de este curso. Una vez aprobado, "
"Credly te notificará que has recibido una insignia.\n"

